  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>αsinx</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>βcosx</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>…</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>…</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>The coefficient of all the powers of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> except <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
